- ### Environment variables
+ ### Variabili d'ambiente

- A variable is read as a member of `Environment`. Its name is written in camel case, and is
- translated to the conventional upper-case form with underscores, so `Environment.editor` reads
- `EDITOR`. The result has the type which the variable is known to hold, decoded from its text:
+ Una variabile si legge come membro di `Environment`. Il suo nome si scrive in camel case, e viene
+ tradotto nella forma convenzionale maiuscola con trattini bassi, così `Environment.editor` legge
+ `EDITOR`. Il risultato ha il tipo che la variabile notoriamente contiene, decodificato dal suo
+ testo:

= `EDITOR`. The result has the type which the variable is known to hold, decoded from its text:
